            "avatar": null,
            "isUploader": false,
            "isVerified": false
          },
          "text": "That’s what’s wrong with society. No one cares about us, the sad,  so we just have to care for each other. Find someone who makes you happy and make them happy. I found my “brother” and you will find yours. Just remember, life goes on even in tough times life will go on",
